<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\誰もいない校舎で.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\キオク\秘密基地入口夕方.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>The sky was tinged a faint orange.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What lay at the end of revenge was a contradictory fact: it destroyed the desire for revenge.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'll impose on them for just one night, then leave here as soon as I can.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Once I'm back in Motoki-cho, I have to rethink who I'll be from now on.<PG>
The breeze, its heat gone, felt wonderfully refreshing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had thought my heart was <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="ゆが">twisted</STYLE>, but it was simpler than I'd imagined.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd only been distracting myself because I was lonely.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From the very start, I could never have killed anyone.<PG>
Tomorrow happens to be the anniversary of <STYLE ID="2">Erina's</STYLE> death. When I get back to Motoki-cho, I'll visit <STYLE ID="2">Erina's</STYLE> grave.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And in front of <STYLE ID="2">Erina</STYLE>, I'll accept reality once more.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As her big sister, I'll go and show <STYLE ID="2">Erina</STYLE> that I'm properly facing forward.<PG>
But... I still regret that we never made up, right to the end.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Well, it's entirely my fault, so I don't intend to complain about it now.<PG>
Oh, come to think of it...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\キオク\日記ぼかし.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
That plan-and-diary I'd left lying on the desk in my room.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If my parents see it by some chance, there'll be real trouble.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd like to hurry home and get rid of it, but...<PG>
But I've sorted out my feelings.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If they've seen it, I'll tell them honestly what's in my heart.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Surely they'll understand.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\キオク\荒田森夕方.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The beauty of this forest, which I hadn't noticed on the way to the secret base.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Just taking a walk here seems enough to make me sound in body and mind.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\夏菜中学バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
It must be because she was born and raised in a place like this that <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE> turned out such a good girl.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And the influence of <STYLE ID="4">Sakura-san</STYLE>, too.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, this forest is so </STYLE><STYLE ID="6" RUBY="きれい">beautiful</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\夏菜中学うずくまり.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Uuh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE> let out something like a groan.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"What's wrong?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"No, it's just, my stomach's been hurting a little for a while now... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">What is this...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\鬱蒼.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
It seemed to be a stomachache.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It didn't look that bad, though...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\夏菜中学バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
Then, suddenly, <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE> lifted her head.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I-I'm sorry! I'm going home ahead of you!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\砂利を走る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "0" "10000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE> left me behind and ran off as fast as she could.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is her stomach really that bad?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I know the way back, and it's still light, so I won't get lost, but...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
