{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Ah, welcome back."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\昼の月.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
When I went inside, <STYLE ID="4">Sakura-san</STYLE> came to greet me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
As if this were my own home.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Sakura-san's</STYLE> smile really is lovely...<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Hasn't </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> come back?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> came home a little while ago. It seems she went to her room on the second floor."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"I see. Thank you."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE> all right? I'll go see how she's doing.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階廊下.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\ノック.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Y-yes..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I knocked on <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan's</STYLE> door, the answer didn't sound very composed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Can I come in?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yes, go ahead..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\ふすま.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\キオク\夏菜の部屋.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\夏菜中学うずくまり.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "4" "2000" "960" "1" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Are you feeling okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Oh, um... yes, I'm fine..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan's</STYLE> face seemed a little red.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And she wasn't really trying to meet my eyes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
How to put it... she looked terribly embarrassed...<PG>
............
{PAUSE ""}
Oh, so that's what it is.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Same sex or not, this isn't something I should pry into any further.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From the look of her, it's probably her first time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, I'll stop even thinking about it. It's far too crude.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"If you're okay, then that's good. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Well, if anything's wrong, come talk to me."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\夏菜中学バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Yes... Thank you."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At last <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE> met my eyes.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But she still seemed embarrassed...<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Uh... </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Momoko-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">for now... please don't tell anyone. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I'll tell them myself..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Okay, I understand."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had been thrown by something that sudden once myself.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I understand that feeling well, so I'll let <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE> do it her way.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"I'm staying here, so I'll go downstairs and help with something."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
