{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"No, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Momoko-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, you're a guest, so please relax. I'll go."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"Is your stomach okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I-I'm fine! It's not like I'm sick."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">But I'll come too, after all. I want to sort out how I've felt up to now as well. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">So I thought I'd properly meet the people here face to face."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Then let's go together."</STYLE><PG>
