{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It seems there's the type who can tell their parents about this kind of thing plainly, and the type who gets all fidgety, like <STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Which one was I?<PG>
