{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Though apparently it didn't work unless she went somewhere narrow...<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
A dark, narrow place―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Unless she's somewhere like a bathroom with the light off, the intuition probably won't work.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But... what is this...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
