{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">But if I stay there more than 15 minutes, I start to feel a little unwell..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Actually, this afternoon too, while I was riding in a taxi, we got stuck in a tunnel with no lights. </STYLE>
