<STYLE ID="5">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, how often does </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Sakura-san's</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> foresight come true?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
