<BR>
I have no proof yet that <STYLE ID="4">Sakura-san</STYLE> belongs to the second generation, but it's 99% certain.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"Is foresight like this something only </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> can do?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"That's right. It'd be a real problem if everyone could do something like that."</STYLE>
